@startuml
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif"

<style>
sequenceDiagram {
  participant {
    Padding 30
    Margin 20
  }
}
</style>

skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam sequenceGroupFontSize 20
skinparam sequenceReferenceFontSize 18
skinparam arrowFontSize 18
skinparam noteFontSize 17
skinparam participantFontSize 20
skinparam actorFontSize 20

skinparam maxMessageSize 380
skinparam wrapWidth 380
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #2C3E50
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #2980B9
skinparam sequenceGroupHeaderFontStyle bold

autonumber

actor "Traveler / Browser\n[Client Web App]" as B #EBF5FB
participant "Fastify 5 BFF API\n[Session Boundary]" as API #E8F8F5
database "PostgreSQL Database\n[app_security schema]" as DB #FEF9E7
participant "Directus 12.1.1\n[Identity Authority]" as DIR #F2F4F4

== User Authentication and Credential Verification ==

B -> API: Submit user credentials\n(POST /api/v1/auth/login)
activate API

API -> DIR: Forward authentication challenge\n(POST /auth/login)
activate DIR
DIR -> DIR: Verify password hash\nusing <b>Argon2id</b>
DIR --> API: Return Directus Token Bundle\n{access_token, refresh_token, user_id, role}
deactivate DIR

== RBAC Assertion & Concurrency Advisory Lock ==

API -> API: Assert user role conforms to <b>travelerRoleId</b>
API -> DB: Acquire transaction-scoped\nadvisory lock on user_id
activate DB
DB --> API: Advisory lock acquired (serialized execution)
API -> DB: Count active unrevoked sessions for user_id
DB --> API: Return active_count (< concurrencyLimit)
deactivate DB

== Server-Side Encryption & Opaque Session Issuance ==

API -> API: Instantiate session family (UUIDv4)\nand 32-byte CSPRNG handle
API -> API: Encrypt tokens via <b>AES-256-GCM</b>\n(256-bit Key, 12-byte IV, 16-byte Tag)

API -> DB: Persist encrypted session record\n(H = SHA-256(handle), ciphertexts, IV, tag)
activate DB
API -> DB: Append security audit event\n(action: login, success, hashed client metadata)
DB --> API: Persisted successfully
deactivate DB

API --> B: HTTP 200 OK\nIssue hardened session cookie\n(__Host- prefix, HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Strict)
deactivate API

note over B, API #D4EFDF
  <b>Strict Token Isolation Guarantee (ADR-004):</b>
  • Browser NEVER receives or stores Directus JWTs (Immune to XSS token theft).
  • Database NEVER stores plaintext handles (Protected against database leaks).
end note

@enduml
